Changes dated 2026-10-02: translated f64 normalization and two-layer sigmoid
inference into Rust; added JSON loading, validation, a small CLI and Java golden
comparisons. No glyph extraction, OCR or full OMR pipeline is implemented.
The original Java files in upstream/ are retained without modifications.

models/basic-classifier.zip is the original Audiveris 5.11.0 bundled model.
models/audiveris-5.11.0.json is a format-only conversion of its XML weights,
normalization values and labels. Original model/source attribution and AGPL
text are retained. The archive contains no separate model license; a separate
model-specific rights grant and full training-data provenance have not been
verified. This package does not relicense those assets as MIT, Apache or CC0.

The synthetic numeric test inputs were newly generated by the local oracle;
expected results were emitted by unmodified Audiveris Java 5.11.0 functions.
No training-score images are bundled. Java is only a reference/test oracle;
production evaluation and the CLI do not call a JVM or Java process.

